---
import BaseLayout from '../../theme/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { useTranslations } from '../../theme/i18n/translations';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import site from '../config/site.json';

const lang = 'en';
const t = await useTranslations(lang);
const title = "About Racine Carrée Calculator";
const description = "Learn about Racine Carrée Calculator — our mission, what we offer, who this site is for, and our commitment to mathematical accuracy.";
const canonicalUrl = `${site.siteUrl}/about-us/`;
---

<BaseLayout 
    title={`${title} | ${site.siteName}`}
    description={description}
    locale={lang}
    canonicalUrl={canonicalUrl}
    isAboutPage={true}
>
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Home', url: '/' }, { label: 'About Us', url: '/about-us/' }]} />
    <div class="page-shell">
        <section class="article-section" id="about-us">
            <div class="article-container">
                <div class="section-eyebrow">
                    <span class="eyebrow-icon">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
                    </span> 
                    Our Story
                </div>
                
                <h1 class="article-h2" style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); font-weight: 900; background: var(--gradient-hero); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; margin-bottom: 24px;">About Racine Carree Calculatorr</h1>
                
                <p class="hero-subtitle" style="max-width: 100%; text-align: left; margin-bottom: 40px; font-size: 1.15rem;">
                    Racine Carree Calculatorr is a free, no-sign-up online tool built for one purpose: to make square root, cube root, and nth root calculations fast, accurate, and genuinely useful. Whether you're a student working through algebra homework, a teacher looking for a quick-reference tool, or a professional who needs a reliable answer in seconds, this site is designed for you.
                </p>

                <!-- Our Mission -->
                <h2 class="article-h2">Our Mission</h2>
                <p>Most online calculators give you a number and stop there. We think that's not enough. Our goal is to give you the answer and help you understand it — with step-by-step breakdowns, simplified radical forms, and clear explanations you can actually learn from.</p>
                <p>We built this site because we were frustrated by tools that were either too basic (just a decimal, no context), too cluttered (ads everywhere, confusing interfaces), or too academic (buried in jargon that doesn't help anyone). So we made something better: a clean, fast calculator backed by real educational content — and we keep it completely free.</p>

                <!-- What We Offer -->
                <h2 class="article-h2" style="margin-top: 48px;">What We Offer</h2>
                <div class="law-cards" style="margin-bottom: 48px;">
                    <div class="law-card">
                        <div class="law-header">
                            <div class="law-number"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/></svg></div>
                            <div><div class="law-label">Three Specialized Calculators</div></div>
                        </div>
                        <p class="law-example">A dedicated <a href="/" style="color: var(--primary-500); font-weight: 600;">Racine Carrée (Square Root) Calculator</a>, a <a href="/racine-cubique-calculator/" style="color: var(--primary-500); font-weight: 600;">Racine Cubique (Cube Root) Calculator</a>, and an <a href="/nth-root-calculator/" style="color: var(--primary-500); font-weight: 600;">Nth Root Calculator</a> that handles any index — all giving you instant, precise results.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="law-card">
                        <div class="law-header">
                            <div class="law-number"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="8" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"/><line x1="8" y1="12" x2="21" y2="12"/><line x1="8" y1="18" x2="21" y2="18"/><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="3.01" y2="6"/><line x1="3" y1="12" x2="3.01" y2="12"/><line x1="3" y1="18" x2="3.01" y2="18"/></svg></div>
                            <div><div class="law-label">Step-by-Step Explanations</div></div>
                        </div>
                        <p class="law-example">Every calculation comes with optional step-by-step workings — so you don't just see the answer, you see how to get there.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="law-card">
                        <div class="law-header">
                            <div class="law-number"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"/><path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"/></svg></div>
                            <div><div class="law-label">In-Depth Educational Content</div></div>
                        </div>
                        <p class="law-example">Each calculator page includes a complete guide covering notation, formulas, core laws, manual methods, reference tables, and FAQs — written in plain English, not textbook jargon.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="law-card law-card--full">
                        <div class="law-header">
                            <div class="law-number"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg></div>
                            <div><div class="law-label">100% Free, No Sign-Up</div></div>
                        </div>
                        <p class="law-example">No accounts, no paywalls, no usage limits. Use it as many times as you want, on any device.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Who This Site Is For -->
                <h2 class="article-h2">Who This Site Is For</h2>
                <div class="applications-grid" style="margin-bottom: 48px;">
                    <div class="app-card">
                        <div class="app-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2H20v20H6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5H20"/></svg></div>
                        <h4>Students</h4>
                        <p>Working through algebra, geometry, or statistics assignments who need quick answers and clear explanations.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="app-card">
                        <div class="app-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg></div>
                        <h4>Teachers & Tutors</h4>
                        <p>Looking for a reliable classroom or homework-help tool.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="app-card">
                        <div class="app-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"/></svg></div>
                        <h4>Professionals</h4>
                        <p>Engineers, architects, data analysts, or anyone who runs into roots in daily work and needs a fast, trustworthy answer.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="app-card">
                        <div class="app-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/></svg></div>
                        <h4>Curious Minds</h4>
                        <p>Anyone who wants to understand what square roots actually are, not just get a number from a search engine.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Why "Racine Carrée"? -->
                <h2 class="article-h2">Why "Racine Carrée"?</h2>
                <p>"Racine carrée" is the French term for square root — and it turns out a large number of English-speaking users search for it this way. Whether from French class, bilingual schooling, or just how they first learned the term, the search volume is real and significant. We named the site to meet those users exactly where they are, while providing everything in English so it's useful to everyone.</p>

                <!-- Our Commitment to Accuracy -->
                <h2 class="article-h2" style="margin-top: 48px;">Our Commitment to Accuracy</h2>
                <p>Every calculator on this site is built to deliver mathematically precise results. We use high-precision floating-point arithmetic, show up to 10 decimal places where applicable, and include verification steps so you can check answers independently. If you ever spot something that doesn't look right, please let us know through our <a href="/contact-us/" style="color: var(--primary-500); font-weight: 600;">Contact Page</a> — accuracy is not something we compromise on.</p>

                <div class="warning-box" style="margin-top: 40px;">
                    <div class="warning-icon">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <div class="warning-content">
                        <strong>Get in Touch</strong>
                        <p style="margin-top: 8px;">Thank you for choosing Racine Carrée Calculator. If you have any suggestions, feature requests, or feedback, please don't hesitate to reach out through our <a href="/contact-us/" style="color: var(--primary-500); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline;">Contact Page</a>.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>
